WEBVTT

00:00:12.726 --> 00:00:15.119
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What are you doing in Oxford today?

00:00:15.332 --> 00:00:18.727
<v><b>Anna:</b></v> I’m here visiting a friend and just looking around.

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:31.203
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What clothes do you usually wear for work?

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:36.085
<v><b>Iain:</b></v> I wear semi-formal clothes, so a shirt and trousers,

00:00:36.086 --> 00:00:37.800
but I don’t need to wear a tie.

00:00:46.705 --> 00:00:48.905
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Would you like to live in England?

00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:49.853
<v><b>Jayna:</b></v> Yes.

00:00:50.926 --> 00:00:51.573
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Why?

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:55.731
<v><b>Jayna:</b></v> The history of the place, and just, um,

00:00:56.238 --> 00:00:57.909
it really is a beautiful country.

00:01:07.342 --> 00:01:09.310
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Are you staying in a hotel?

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:10.480
<v><b>Sandra:</b></v> Yes.

00:01:11.133 --> 00:01:12.100
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Do you like it?

00:01:12.808 --> 00:01:14.121
<v><b>Sandra:</b></v> Yes, I like it very much.

00:01:14.842 --> 00:01:15.517
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Why?

00:01:16.563 --> 00:01:20.475
<v><b>Sandra:</b></v> It’s situated near the river, it’s really nice and cosy,

00:01:20.476 --> 00:01:23.440
they serve pints in the evening, so we’re fine.

00:01:32.927 --> 00:01:35.357
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Where were you at ten o’clock last night?

00:01:35.358 --> 00:01:37.877
<v><b>Spencer:</b></v> At ten o’clock last night I was in my hotel room.